abstract: >-
  A draft framework and self-assessment for judging whether an organization
  can turn faster AI-driven coding into faster, safer delivery. Includes a
  written specification, eight assessment dimensions, maturity levels,
  autonomy tiers, baseline metrics and an interactive assessment tool.
  Status: proposed framework, not validated.
keywords:
  - software delivery
  - agentic software engineering
  - readiness assessment
  - theory of constraints
  - verification
